Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 22:16:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(desktop): instant archive keeps offline owner isolation
 and pin edits [daveey]

Review of PR #1143 (t_01a1cc80dc419f65) found three regressions:
- offline-cached rows were tombstoned by bare id, hiding another owner's
  cached chat with the same id: offline rows are no longer pre-hidden
  (their owner-scoped queue path hides them, as on main);
- Cancel restored the whole pin snapshot, dropping pin edits made while
  the dialog was open: restore re-inserts only the pins archive removed;
- rollback inserted a cache-only row into the live list: restore puts
  back only the row a live slice actually held.
Each has a test that fails on 83d1d367eb1d and passes here.
